# ─── AI Agent artifacts (Hermes / Copilot / Codex / Kilo etc.) ───
# Agent working dirs, debug logs, and decay-tag sidecars leak into repos
# when coding agents run inside them. Exclude proactively.
.hermes/
.hermes2/
.copilotmd
*.copilotmd
*.decaytag.json
*.opid.json
.skillcat-registry.json
REFACTORING_PLAN.md
AGENT_*.md
agent-*.log

# >>> HERMES AI-AGENT-ARTIFACT BLOCK v2 (idempotent) >>>
# Excludes AI coding-agent working dirs/logs from every repo so agents
# (Hermes, Copilot, Codex, Kilo, OpenClaude) cannot leak runtime artifacts into git.
# Added by project-explorer. Safe to keep. Patterns are framework-agnostic.
.hermes/
.hermes2/
.copilotmd
*.copilotmd
*.decaytag.json
*.opid.json
.skillcat-registry.json
REFACTORING_PLAN.md
AGENT_*.md
agent-*.log
.lazycommit.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.claude/settings.local.json
# AI-agent generated doc-spam (lazycommit/harbor/etc. drop these into repos)
*CRITICAL_ISSUES*.md
*MASTER_TODO*.md
*MINOR_TODO*.md
*completion*.md
*completion-email*.md
# <<< HERMES AI-AGENT-ARTIFACT BLOCK <<<
